<%# One owner for the streams that follow the current user's unread count:
    the sidebar frame (notifications/_nav_count) and the hidden count-data
    frame that raises notifications:count-updated for every other listener
    (mobile nav). Rendered by the inbox turbo_stream templates (update,
    mark_all_read, archive_all) and broadcast by
    Notifications::BroadcastService#broadcast_badge_update, so all four
    writers send the same thing. Both targets are frames whose partial's ROOT
    is the frame: a replace swaps the target for that root, nothing more.
    Guard: spec/requests/inbox_nav_count_stream_spec.rb. %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace 'nav_notifications_count',
                         partial: 'notifications/nav_count',
                         locals: { unread_count: unread_count } %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace 'notification_count_data',
                         partial: 'notifications/count_data_frame',
                         locals: { count: unread_count } %>
